      ],
      "source": "https://townofeureka.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The western area of Eureka features rolling hills and valleys, while the eastern side is flat and suited for farming.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://townofeureka.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Eureka is a quiet rural setting with no incorporated villages or cities within its boundaries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://townofeureka.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Small farms primarily make up the landscape of Eureka, though the area includes several larger developments.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://townofeureka.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Proximity to the Twin Cities has led to the construction of many single family homes throughout Eureka.",
